        {
          "type": "caption",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "The visualisation shows a viewer afterimage shifting between now and a user-set maximum delay. Delay and modulation speed are tuned with the controller knobs, inviting agency over time while asking how much control we really have."
            }
          ]
